      "name": "Omar Mohammed",
      "created_at": "2023-12-26T19:03:22.510Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Is there any documentation or steps to do this?</p>\n<p>I want for example when post some thing on facebook, that create a new <strong>document</strong> in custom doctype, and this is will connect with all comments that created for this post and store in another doctype, and can reply on this comment from ERPnext</p>",
