      "name": "Woakes070048",
      "created_at": "2023-12-26T19:09:34.558Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We don’t have any of it documented. For the comments we send all of those to chatwoot through the API to respond. With all of that being said I don’t see why you cant send it to a Social Comments Doctype. I think the workflows would be similar the workflow endpoint would just be erpnext doctypes over chatwoots conversations.</p>\n<p>When I get the time I will document what we have built for workflows. Im not 100% when I will have the time we are in the process of a new product launch.</p>",
