      "cooked": "<p>I found this - <a href=\"https://github.com/efeone/frappe_meta_integration\" class=\"inline-onebox\">GitHub - efeone/frappe_meta_integration: Meta Cloud API Integration for frappe framework</a><br>\non this list - <a href=\"https://github.com/gavindsouza/awesome-frappe?tab=readme-ov-file\" class=\"inline-onebox\">GitHub - gavindsouza/awesome-frappe: A curated list of awesome things related to the Frappe Framework</a></p>\n<p>Hope it helps</p>",
