    {
      "id": 494915,
      "username": "Canrytistgluc",
      "name": null,
      "created_at": "2026-02-23T18:41:47.164Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can hook social feeds into ERPNext using webhooks and the REST APIs from Meta, but you’ll likely need a small custom app to catch messages, store them in DocTypes, and trigger workflows. I built something similar while using <a href=\"https://socialprofiler.com/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://socialprofiler.com/</a> for quick checks on inbound leads, and the same idea applies here: pull data in through API calls, map it to fields, and let ERPNext handle the rest.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/dec6dc/{size}.png",
